    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>This insect's compound eyes and quiet yet powerful wings make it an excellent aerial hunter.</p><p><strong>Melee</strong> <span class=\"pf2-icon\">1</span> horn, <strong>Damage</strong> 1d6 piercing</p><p><strong>Melee</strong> <span class=\"pf2-icon\">1</span> hoof, <strong>Damage</strong> 1d6 bludgeoning</p><p><strong>Str</strong> +3, <strong>Dex</strong> +1, <strong>Con</strong> +1, <strong>Int</strong> –2, <strong>Wis</strong> +2, <strong>Cha</strong> +1</p><p><strong>Hit Points</strong> 6</p><p><strong>Skill</strong> Diplomacy</p><p><strong>Senses</strong> darkvision, scent (imprecise) 30 feet</p><p><strong>Speed</strong> 45 feet</p><p><strong>Special</strong> mount; the unicorn speaks and understands Common and Fey</p><p><strong>Support Benefit</strong> Your unicorn's horn shines with a pearlescent, sacred light that chases away the darkness. Until the start of your next turn, your unicorn sheds bright light in a 10-foot radius; within this light, you and your Strikes gain the holy trait and receive the benefits of a ghost touch rune.</p><p><strong>Advanced Maneuver</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.AC-Advanced-Maneuvers.Item.EVoA5xmVjUUxPMWG]{Invigorating Nobility}</p>"
    },
